{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-02", "pageid": 134863, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-01\" title=\"死生对位-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-03\" title=\"死生对位-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.89.80.E6.8E.A2.E7.A9.B6.E7.9A.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"所探究的\">所探究的</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 所探究的</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">What Is Pried</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"daxuekeshi\"><img alt=\"daxuekeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/600px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/900px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/Cg-daxuekeshi.png/1200px-Cg-daxuekeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1987年，剑桥大学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阴冷潮湿的风拂过树梢，讲台上，渡鸦教授短暂地被簌簌声吸引了注意力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>……总而言之，上述系统虽然完全由确定的方程支配，但依然可以表现得充满混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>这个感觉就像是在阅读《精神现象学》——在缜密的推论中头晕目眩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>注意，我没有推荐你们去阅读任何哲学著作。今天的课就到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>学生们纷纷道别。他将讲义收拾完毕，留意到仍有三两学生并未离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>托特教授。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>我看起来是渡鸦，并不像朱鹭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>距离你入学已有一段时日，这段时间适应得如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>托您的福，一切都好。我想，课业相关的内容，您可以从课题报告上看到，无需来问我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面前的学生漫不经心地解释着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>是的，《大气中微子反常现象对振荡模型的启示》，非常出色的文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>客观来说，它有些超出当前时代的进度，但物理学不该随着时代而倒退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>看来不仅是课业，你对这个年代也适应得很好。是我多虑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“这个年代”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她咀嚼着这突如其来的字眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>噢，您并没有忘记发生在1999年的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“哲学教授是世界上最荒唐的职业”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>这正是我如今站在这里的原因，以物理学客座教授的身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>剑桥大学对于科算中心普列谢茨克分部正在进行的研究非常感兴趣，邀请我在闲暇时过来授课。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>1999年，因为当时的时代剧变，我无法再延续教职，而错过了举荐你的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>如今，很高兴看到你也跨越了“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>您不关心我是如何做到的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>这会影响你的课题报告吗？还是说会影响你的生活？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>哈，当然不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>既然如此，它就是属于个人的隐私。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>下周太空站的航空实验讲座，如果你有兴趣的话，也可以来旁听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>感谢您的邀请，托特教授。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>我明白了，这是你独特的幽默感，玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">路德维希：</div><div>周四下午三点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认对方已明晰讲座的时间与地点，鸟头先生礼貌地颔首，随之道别离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>再见，路德维希先生——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>作为一个巨大的谜团，真希望你每次出现的时候，都会给我带来全新的谜题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这样才不算无趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>转学生漠然地盯着遗留在黑板上的公式与文字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>另外，你有什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你已经在后面偷听了很久了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一道人影手足无措地从座位上站起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>抱歉，我并非有意的。我只是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>你好，我叫安妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>你就是玛格丽特对吗？《大气中微子反常现象对振荡模型的启示》的作者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特抬起头来，认真地打量了一番与她搭话的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎是一瞬间，她就掌握了自己所需要的信息：身份，年龄，处境，性格——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温和得有些怯懦的好学生，过度的同理心，无效的人际边界，优良的家境，因出身受到排挤而缺乏同伴……这一切都共同构成了面前的女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>并且，她在学校里过得不算好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>他们都说你是天才，明明缺席了先前好几个学期的课程，却依旧能写出这样的文章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>我，我也看过你的课题报告……太厉害了，我很敬佩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这里最不缺的就是天才。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>转学生扫了一眼对方放在桌面上的笔记本，她的意图并不难猜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精致的皮质封面，端正的课堂笔记，最底下写着：下午三点，周四。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她并没有作声，只是等待着女孩演完这场漫长的戏码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>刚刚路德维希教授提到的讲座，如果可以的话，我能和你一起去吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>听高年级的同学说，讲座里似乎有需要双人协作的内容——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-614420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安妮：</div><div>玛格丽特，我想邀请你一同前往。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面具般的脸上露出了一个不算熟练的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>一个新的惊喜。我同意了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>安妮。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/00/Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_toumingpoyifangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>安妮……安妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在回过神来时，如蜜般的名字已在唇舌间流淌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>她是个有趣的好女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>如果你真的关注过安妮的事情，那么你应该知晓，警方调查的结果是，安妮的死只是一场意外。她有先天性心脏疾病，让人很遗憾，但仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>别误会，我没想佯装听不懂你的弦外之音，我只是好奇，你的指控从何而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你看起来并不是一个没有依据就会贸然提出猜想的研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙看着她平静的面孔，犹豫不决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你在担心什么呢？这里是拉普拉斯科算中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我们身处如此安全的环境，且你看起来心结很深，我们完全可以开诚布公地聊聊，把误会解开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>在某次课堂结束后，我看过你留在黑板上的方程与题解……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>那和我们的课堂内容没什么关系，也显然不是普通的方程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你就这样堂而皇之地把它写在教室的正中央，一个所有人都会看到的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>仿佛等待着什么人发现它一样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>哦？那它是什么方程呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灰金发的研究员温和地鼓励她继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>那是……人类的行为模式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>某个你所熟知的人，某个特殊的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>那是安妮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你将安妮解析为不断迭代的数学模型，通过这样的方式来预测她的行动，分析她的决策过程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>黑板上的方程已经完成了。这甚至没有耗费你多长的时间去解开……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>在当时，你究竟想要对安妮做些什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员饶有兴致地听着这一切堪称荒谬的指控。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你的意思是：我想要了解人们的行为——以方程的模式？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>非常有趣且有新意的想法，黑墙研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……别尝试敷衍我，玛格丽特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>好吧，我很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>如果你真的认为发生在安妮身上的意外，背后有什么隐藏的动机甚至真凶——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特什么也没说，只是从诸多文件夹与稿纸间抽出一本笔记递给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>精致的皮质封面，略显陈旧，纸张也微微泛黄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙心中一动，她接过了笔记本，将其翻开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>端正的字体，有条理的课堂笔记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太空站，下午三点，周四。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这是安妮的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我不明白，你为什么随身携带着这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>今天早上，我在助理希曼的桌子上看见了一张派遣名单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>“黑墙”这个笔名，曾多次出现在剑桥的小报上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……你从一开始就知道我要和你聊这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>而这正是你想要得到的线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙略有迟疑，但仍然无法拒绝探知真相的诱惑，最终接过笔记本离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在黑墙离开会议室之后，玛格丽特把空茶杯向前推了推。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>银色的水壶从吊灯上落下，微微倾倒，茶水稳稳落入杯中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>又猜中了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>明明我在吊灯水壶和面包糠发射文件夹之间犹豫了好久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从天而降的显然不只有水壶，还有她那无所事事的同僚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>希望下次的“意外事故”能有意思一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好的，遵命！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>最近的研究，有什么需要我帮忙的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>泽维尔，你显然不是来关心我的研究成果的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你知道这只是小春雀儿在废墟里找到的那条狗的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>所以呢？它现在应该已经消失在“暴雨”里了，你就继承它的名字吧，泽维尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>好吧。我只是来问问，小春雀儿的助手工作做得如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>毕竟是我推荐给你的助手，希望她没有给你惹什么麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>客观来说，她是一个好小孩儿，也是一个好助手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>如果这个助手不是因为你懒得教会她更多的东西而塞给我的话，你的关怀会更有可信度一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你知道的，我没法教给她什么有用的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>杀手先生与杀手女士对视一眼，心照不宣地绕开了这个话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我发现你对这个无聊的环流观测小组很上心，所以忍不住来亲眼看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你就是想找点乐趣，是不是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>你的吊灯水壶和面包糠发射文件夹，不算“找点乐趣”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我们的乐趣显然大相径庭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你继续和你的无聊小组玩吧，抽空来帮我实验喷气式倒立滑行机！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛伦兹蝴蝶：</div><div>那我接下来很长的一段时间都不会有空了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-02"}}